1
00:00:00,058 --> 00:00:08,406
Scripture is available everywhere. But the experience is still fragmented and in disconnected formats. The challenge isn't access to Scripture.

2
00:00:08,557 --> 00:00:12,516
It's creating an experience that invites people to return to it, again and again.

3
00:00:12,899 --> 00:00:20,305
At the same time, ministries need new and simpler ways to create Scripture centered experiences that reach people in new ways.

